WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.420 --> 01:42.340
[Episode 11]

01:46.950 --> 01:49.260
Without power,

01:49.590 --> 01:51.660
you'd set such a thorough trap.

01:51.710 --> 01:53.820
Why attack when you can ambush?

01:54.230 --> 01:56.740
Why use powers when you can poison?

01:59.560 --> 02:01.410
What's with that disgusted look?

02:01.560 --> 02:03.410
Too bad all your effort

02:03.590 --> 02:05.330
won't work on the locals.

02:05.350 --> 02:07.850
Didn't you say they know no spells?

02:07.950 --> 02:09.410
More than that.

02:09.630 --> 02:10.410
They're...

02:12.590 --> 02:13.410
Forget it.

02:13.840 --> 02:15.170
You'll see when you meet them.

02:21.190 --> 02:22.100
Here they come.

02:34.710 --> 02:36.570
Why won't the doors open?

02:49.590 --> 02:50.780
You're awake.

02:52.800 --> 02:53.780
See?

02:55.630 --> 02:56.780
What do you mean?

02:58.240 --> 02:59.170
Now you know

02:59.190 --> 03:01.410
I put you here to heal.

03:02.030 --> 03:02.820
Heal?

03:03.910 --> 03:05.220
You call that healing?

03:05.240 --> 03:05.980
This woodshed

03:06.000 --> 03:08.010
is the coziest spot in Bear Stockade.

03:08.030 --> 03:09.610
Warm and quiet.

03:10.240 --> 03:12.010
You don't like it?

03:13.240 --> 03:14.940
Then what's with the shackles?

03:14.960 --> 03:16.570
Feared you'd roll around

03:16.590 --> 03:17.850
and hurt yourselves more.

03:17.960 --> 03:19.780
Seeing your skinny limbs,

03:19.800 --> 03:21.410
I used lighter chains.

03:21.430 --> 03:23.290
Otherwise, our dog chains

03:23.310 --> 03:24.610
are way thicker than these.

03:27.960 --> 03:29.340
Thanks for your care.

03:29.430 --> 03:30.170
Don't mention it.

03:30.190 --> 03:32.100
We'll never forget this.

03:32.120 --> 03:32.820
Bye.

03:35.710 --> 03:36.780
You are leaving?

03:37.400 --> 03:39.220
Didn't you say to heal?

03:39.310 --> 03:40.380
My injury's healed.

03:40.400 --> 03:41.540
I don't know about her,

03:41.560 --> 03:42.170
but I'm fine.

03:42.190 --> 03:43.450
Can I leave first?

03:45.400 --> 03:46.780
Why leave?

03:47.150 --> 03:48.780
Bear Stockade

03:48.800 --> 03:49.380
is the world's

03:49.400 --> 03:50.540
most wonderful place.

03:50.560 --> 03:52.450
Nobody who comes wants to leave.

03:54.910 --> 03:55.690
Lady,

03:56.150 --> 03:58.820
pardon my frankness.

03:59.190 --> 04:00.610
This place,

04:00.840 --> 04:03.010
though not a harsh land,

04:03.030 --> 04:04.610
it's still a desolate wilderness.

04:04.630 --> 04:06.540
No aura above, no essence below.

04:06.560 --> 04:07.820
You can't grow crops

04:07.840 --> 04:09.170
or achieve greatness.

04:09.240 --> 04:10.060
The two of us

04:10.470 --> 04:11.780
left our homes.

04:11.800 --> 04:12.980
Every night

04:13.000 --> 04:14.220
I think of my homeland,

04:14.240 --> 04:15.410
and my heart gets...

04:17.310 --> 04:18.220
We're staying.

04:19.630 --> 04:20.410
Really?

04:27.040 --> 04:28.290
Told you.

04:28.310 --> 04:29.290
Bear Stockade is the best.

04:29.310 --> 04:30.780
Nobody wants to leave.

04:30.800 --> 04:32.140
I'll show you around.

04:51.310 --> 04:51.780
Come on.

04:56.830 --> 04:58.340
No dawdling now.

04:58.630 --> 04:59.460
Move along.

05:00.270 --> 05:01.020
On Bear Island,

05:01.040 --> 05:02.290
only beasts work till they drop.

05:02.310 --> 05:03.610
No fallow field is ruined by tilling.

05:09.920 --> 05:12.020
Bear Island has comfy weather

05:12.040 --> 05:13.020
and fresh air.

05:16.240 --> 05:17.980
Look at everyone working.

05:18.000 --> 05:19.730
So at ease, so joyful.

05:19.800 --> 05:21.020
Seriously?

05:21.720 --> 05:23.810
It really breeds uniqueness.

05:23.830 --> 05:25.020
Fits the name.

05:26.750 --> 05:27.930
The Dragon King didn't lie.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.290
The Pregenesis Sword

05:29.720 --> 05:30.780
is indeed here.

05:31.720 --> 05:32.930
How did you know?

05:34.190 --> 05:35.020
The Pregenesis Sword

05:35.240 --> 05:36.610
was made by Ancestral Witch heirs.

05:36.950 --> 05:38.810
Legend says after the ancient war,

05:38.830 --> 05:41.580
they guarded it until today.

05:41.600 --> 05:42.810
Ancestral Witch heirs?

06:03.920 --> 06:04.810
Forgot to introduce.

06:05.390 --> 06:07.340
This is my brother, Xiong Da.

06:08.000 --> 06:08.780
Greetings.

06:09.040 --> 06:10.810
This is my other brother, Xiong Er.

06:11.000 --> 06:11.780
Greetings.

06:12.360 --> 06:13.140
Let me guess.

06:13.430 --> 06:14.610
Xiong San, right?

06:14.630 --> 06:15.410
You fool.

06:15.510 --> 06:16.780
My sister is Xiong Lingli.

06:17.190 --> 06:18.410
Guessing wrong on that.

06:18.430 --> 06:20.020
Are you an idiot?

06:25.720 --> 06:27.370
You chose the right boss.

06:27.600 --> 06:28.290
Lingli

06:28.310 --> 06:30.220
is Chief's precious jewel

06:30.390 --> 06:31.980
and our village's

06:32.000 --> 06:33.850
wild beauty.

06:34.560 --> 06:35.540
Brother.

06:38.270 --> 06:40.250
You're embarrassing me.

06:40.310 --> 06:41.140
Stop it.

06:43.920 --> 06:45.250
He said it. Why hit me?

06:48.120 --> 06:49.580
Look how skinny they are.

06:49.600 --> 06:50.290
Yeah.

06:50.310 --> 06:51.780
Outside world must be tough.

06:51.800 --> 06:52.980
You must be starving.

06:53.000 --> 06:53.700
Don't worry.

06:53.950 --> 06:56.020
Good times start on Bear Island.

06:56.040 --> 06:57.730
No more hardship from now on.

06:57.830 --> 06:59.170
Everyone who came here

06:59.190 --> 07:00.170
has never left.

07:00.190 --> 07:00.810
Yeah.

07:00.830 --> 07:02.050
No one's ever left.

07:03.630 --> 07:04.580
No one

07:05.830 --> 07:06.810
has left?

07:08.560 --> 07:09.220
Then I...

07:09.240 --> 07:10.020
It's time.

07:24.240 --> 07:26.370
Bear Island is so great.

07:26.430 --> 07:28.610
We love Bear Island.

07:28.800 --> 07:31.020
Listen to the deity.

07:31.120 --> 07:33.220
And we'll live forever.

07:33.310 --> 07:35.540
Bear Island is so great.

07:35.630 --> 07:37.810
We love Bear Island.

07:37.920 --> 07:40.020
Listen to the deity.

07:40.040 --> 07:42.040
- I see.
- And we'll live forever.

07:42.760 --> 07:43.260
Again.

07:43.260 --> 07:44.880
- See the catch here?
- Bear Island...

07:44.880 --> 07:46.480
- I see why Dragon King sent me here.
- is so great.

07:46.480 --> 07:47.160
We love...

07:47.270 --> 07:48.020
- Why?
- Bear Island.

07:48.040 --> 07:50.460
- They say no one's ever left.
- Listen to the deity.

07:50.710 --> 07:52.700
- Not because they don't want to.
- And we'll live forever.

07:52.860 --> 07:54.680
- But because they can't.
- Bear Island is so great.

07:54.720 --> 07:56.740
- This island cancels all power,
- We love Bear Island.

07:56.780 --> 07:58.260
- and is guarded by these weirdos,
- Listen...

07:58.300 --> 07:59.380
- so the Dragon King believed...
- to the deity.

07:59.400 --> 08:01.570
- if lured here, I can never escape.
- And we'll live forever.

08:01.630 --> 08:03.910
- Let alone take the Sea-Calming Pillar.
- Bear Island is so great.

08:04.140 --> 08:06.130
- So...
- We love Bear Island.

08:06.330 --> 08:07.970
- It's a trap?
- Listen to the deity.

08:07.970 --> 08:10.390
- The Dragon King's trap for me.
- And we'll live forever.

08:10.500 --> 08:14.740
- A trap for you?
- Bear Island is so great. We love...

08:14.830 --> 08:16.860
- His scheme
- Listen to the deity.

08:16.920 --> 08:18.760
- traps you here
- And we'll live forever.

08:18.760 --> 08:20.850
even without me.

08:21.000 --> 08:23.020
What am I doing here?

08:37.510 --> 08:40.730
So I came here for nothing?

08:40.960 --> 08:43.060
What was it all for?

08:44.200 --> 08:49.300
What for?

08:52.390 --> 08:53.220
What for?

09:16.630 --> 09:19.850
Deep in this illusion,

09:20.120 --> 09:23.250
we must stay steady in mind.

09:24.000 --> 09:27.610
That's the true meaning of cultivation.

09:29.840 --> 09:30.940
Right, Changshou?

09:46.240 --> 09:47.610
Makes sense.

09:58.270 --> 09:59.060
Mentor.

10:06.360 --> 10:07.130
Mentor.

10:09.150 --> 10:09.940
Changshou,

10:11.030 --> 10:13.010
my hallucinations got worse.

10:13.390 --> 10:14.370
Mentor.

10:14.600 --> 10:15.420
Mentor.

10:15.790 --> 10:17.010
It may not be an illusion.

10:18.200 --> 10:19.580
Ling'e is truly here.

10:19.600 --> 10:21.460
Mentor. Mentor.

10:22.200 --> 10:22.890
Mentor.

10:26.600 --> 10:27.420
Mentor.

10:27.630 --> 10:28.460
Mentor.

10:30.030 --> 10:31.370
It really is Ling'e.

10:31.630 --> 10:32.420
Told you so.

10:32.440 --> 10:33.420
It is Ling'e.

10:34.000 --> 10:35.700
Mentor, thank you for waiting.

10:35.720 --> 10:36.420
Ling'e.

10:36.960 --> 10:37.940
Why are you alone?

10:37.960 --> 10:39.420
Where is that little brat?

10:39.600 --> 10:40.370
Mentor, rest assured.

10:40.390 --> 10:42.340
Senior set this barrier.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.180
I can break it.

10:43.440 --> 10:44.220
Great.

10:45.480 --> 10:46.250
Break.

10:49.150 --> 10:49.940
Break.

10:53.120 --> 10:53.890
Break.

10:57.910 --> 10:58.700
Senior.

10:58.750 --> 10:59.820
Help her out.

10:59.960 --> 11:00.340
Sure.

11:03.240 --> 11:03.940
Why?

11:04.600 --> 11:05.370
Senior.

11:06.000 --> 11:06.770
Ling'e.

11:29.510 --> 11:32.010
Fairy Yunxiao is trapped
on the island by the Dragon King.

11:32.240 --> 11:34.420
Once I report this to Celestial Court,

11:34.440 --> 11:36.420
they'll set a blockade around.

11:36.720 --> 11:38.220
Then I can make amends.

11:47.870 --> 11:48.730
What happened?

11:50.750 --> 11:52.340
Forgot I have no power here.

11:54.510 --> 11:56.340
Going blindly without research.

11:56.510 --> 11:58.250
A hard lesson. Never again.

11:59.030 --> 11:59.610
No worries.

12:00.320 --> 12:01.460
I can still swim out.

12:14.360 --> 12:15.490
Why are you here?

12:17.550 --> 12:19.130
Why are you here?

12:19.360 --> 12:20.730
I fish here every day.

12:20.750 --> 12:22.530
Come to the beach, and you'll see me.

12:22.870 --> 12:24.130
You here to fish too?

12:24.750 --> 12:26.180
I'm here to slack off.

12:26.630 --> 12:28.300
Were you trying to leave?

12:28.960 --> 12:30.820
Such a wonderful place.

12:30.840 --> 12:31.730
Just stay.

12:31.750 --> 12:32.850
I will.

12:33.510 --> 12:35.250
How could I leave this place?

12:38.150 --> 12:38.940
Is this place

12:40.320 --> 12:41.490
seriously impossible

12:43.030 --> 12:44.940
to leave?

13:04.750 --> 13:05.850
His scent

13:06.720 --> 13:08.130
vanished right here.

13:12.270 --> 13:13.060
No.

13:13.750 --> 13:15.530
I must find you, sir.

13:16.480 --> 13:18.060
To shatter dragon pride,

13:18.240 --> 13:19.650
rebuild dragon glory,

13:20.320 --> 13:22.130
and usher in a new era,

13:22.510 --> 13:26.820
I shall become the light!

13:42.750 --> 13:43.530
Light out.

13:47.910 --> 13:50.130
Bear Island is so great.

13:50.960 --> 13:52.980
Time to bathe, I can't wait.

13:53.480 --> 13:55.250
Caught a fish upon my bait.

13:55.870 --> 13:57.940
Eating full upon my plate.

14:03.870 --> 14:05.130
Sorry, little fishy.

14:12.910 --> 14:15.060
Are fish birthing humans now?

14:25.960 --> 14:27.060
We'll go together tonight.

14:27.080 --> 14:27.490
All right.

14:45.440 --> 14:46.490
Why are you looking at me?

14:48.960 --> 14:49.770
Nothing.

14:50.150 --> 14:50.940
Nothing.

14:51.550 --> 14:52.370
Yunxiao.

14:52.910 --> 14:54.730
When do you plan to escape?

14:54.840 --> 14:55.730
Why should I escape?

14:57.480 --> 14:58.490
Do you intend...

14:58.510 --> 15:00.650
This is
where Ancestral Witch heirs gather.

15:00.670 --> 15:02.130
The Pregenesis Sword
is likely right here.

15:02.150 --> 15:03.130
Without finding the sword,

15:03.240 --> 15:04.300
I won't leave.

15:04.720 --> 15:05.250
But that is...

15:05.270 --> 15:05.890
Who?

15:06.550 --> 15:07.340
Who?

15:08.240 --> 15:09.340
Who changed my clothes?

15:10.440 --> 15:11.770
Second Prince?

15:11.870 --> 15:12.460
What?

15:12.480 --> 15:13.180
Who changed my clothes?

15:13.200 --> 15:14.060
Your enemy?

15:14.200 --> 15:14.940
No, no.

15:14.960 --> 15:15.980
Not that.

15:17.790 --> 15:18.340
He...

15:18.360 --> 15:20.300
Do not dwell on him.

15:20.320 --> 15:21.580
Why not?

15:22.320 --> 15:23.580
He's nuts.

15:23.870 --> 15:24.650
These clothes...

15:25.150 --> 15:26.060
Did you change me?

15:27.030 --> 15:27.820
No.

15:28.080 --> 15:28.820
Did he?

15:28.840 --> 15:29.730
You changed me?

15:32.320 --> 15:33.700
I prepared the clothes.

15:33.720 --> 15:34.890
Is there a problem?

15:34.960 --> 15:37.130
Of course there is.

15:37.150 --> 15:38.180
These clothes...

15:38.960 --> 15:40.180
Who put them on me?

15:41.750 --> 15:43.130
You are a girl.

15:43.440 --> 15:45.060
So a girl helped you change.

15:45.080 --> 15:45.820
I am...

15:47.390 --> 15:50.300
How can you tell I'm a girl?

15:50.360 --> 15:53.130
You're slim and fair-featured.

15:53.150 --> 15:54.730
Of course you're a girl.

15:56.550 --> 15:58.100
I must teach you a thing or two.

15:58.120 --> 15:58.580
Since I was little...

15:58.600 --> 16:00.130
Men go to work,

16:00.750 --> 16:02.130
and girls get to rest.

16:04.360 --> 16:05.850
Since I was little,

16:05.870 --> 16:07.130
I've been

16:07.440 --> 16:08.250
a little girl.

16:11.550 --> 16:13.530
What a pretty girl.

16:23.160 --> 16:24.200
- Taste it.
- So pretty.

16:24.200 --> 16:25.480
- Eat up.
- Have some more.

16:25.480 --> 16:26.700
- Go ahead.
- Such a beauty.

16:26.720 --> 16:27.530
Have some.

16:27.530 --> 16:28.360
Have a bite.

16:28.360 --> 16:28.940
Try some.

16:28.960 --> 16:29.490
Give it a taste.

16:29.510 --> 16:30.490
Such a pretty girl.

16:30.510 --> 16:31.100
So lovely.

16:31.120 --> 16:31.820
No thanks.

16:37.960 --> 16:38.610
Who is it?

16:38.960 --> 16:39.940
That is for slacking off.

16:39.960 --> 16:40.770
No, no.

16:40.790 --> 16:41.530
I was not slacking off.

16:41.550 --> 16:42.580
I...

16:42.600 --> 16:44.250
I grew tired from digging.

16:44.270 --> 16:45.770
Just wanted a quick break.

16:48.030 --> 16:48.770
Keep digging.

16:49.030 --> 16:50.340
Dig less than three feet today,

16:50.360 --> 16:51.010
no dinner for you.

16:51.030 --> 16:52.300
That's right.

16:54.120 --> 16:55.060
Do you really

16:55.080 --> 16:56.460
have to dig?

16:56.550 --> 16:57.530
Must it be done?

17:00.750 --> 17:01.340
Don't.

17:01.360 --> 17:02.130
No, wait.

17:02.320 --> 17:03.340
I mean,

17:03.630 --> 17:06.180
it must be done.

17:06.440 --> 17:08.250
How could we not dig?

17:09.680 --> 17:10.770
Exactly.

17:11.200 --> 17:11.900
That's right.

17:11.920 --> 17:12.660
How could we not dig?

17:12.680 --> 17:13.250
Yes, yes.

17:13.270 --> 17:13.700
Get to work.

17:13.720 --> 17:14.330
Hurry up.

17:15.030 --> 17:15.490
Go on.

17:15.750 --> 17:16.140
Get up.

17:16.160 --> 17:16.860
Start working.

17:17.350 --> 17:18.330
Yes, yes.

17:19.350 --> 17:19.900
Excuse me.

17:22.550 --> 17:24.660
Grab your tools.

17:24.680 --> 17:26.140
Bear Island rules.

17:26.550 --> 17:28.380
Grab your tools.

17:28.400 --> 17:29.490
Bear Island rules.

17:29.510 --> 17:30.770
The Human Clan is so fierce.

17:30.790 --> 17:32.090
Labor is glorious.

17:32.110 --> 17:34.460
- Bear Island rules.
- Dragon Clan must learn.

17:34.480 --> 17:36.460
Hey, let me through.

17:36.830 --> 17:38.060
Fresh fish soup.

17:38.600 --> 17:39.740
Easy. Easy.

17:39.880 --> 17:40.580
This should knock you out.

17:40.680 --> 17:42.490
Then I can make my escape.

17:44.550 --> 17:45.700
Ten times the dose.

17:45.720 --> 17:47.250
Surely that'll finish you off.

17:49.480 --> 17:50.460
I've never had

17:50.480 --> 17:51.530
such delicious fish soup.

17:51.550 --> 17:52.050
Right.

17:52.070 --> 17:53.660
Never tasted soup this good.

17:53.680 --> 17:54.250
Another bowl.

17:54.270 --> 17:55.050
More.

17:55.070 --> 17:55.940
All gone.

17:56.070 --> 17:57.180
I'll make more tomorrow.

17:57.440 --> 17:58.330
Here's one last drop.

17:59.070 --> 18:01.180
Such a dose failed?

18:01.440 --> 18:03.140
Frustrating.

18:05.440 --> 18:06.860
Without power,

18:06.880 --> 18:09.090
sleep won't reach Celestial Court.

18:10.110 --> 18:12.770
I must find a way out.

18:35.680 --> 18:36.460
Who are you?

18:38.680 --> 18:39.530
New here?

18:41.070 --> 18:42.220
Here to loaf around?

18:43.590 --> 18:44.180
Sit.

18:49.510 --> 18:50.620
Look at this scenery.

18:51.590 --> 18:52.380
So beautiful.

18:53.590 --> 18:54.620
This air.

18:56.960 --> 18:57.940
So fresh.

18:58.920 --> 18:59.700
Bear Island

19:01.270 --> 19:02.570
is isolated from the world.

19:02.790 --> 19:03.980
No strife.

19:06.000 --> 19:07.530
What a paradise.

19:10.350 --> 19:12.180
Seeing this scene,

19:13.200 --> 19:14.620
poetry strikes me.

19:15.480 --> 19:16.250
My friend.

19:16.480 --> 19:19.090
Care to hear a verse?

19:28.550 --> 19:29.810
The ocean vast

19:31.400 --> 19:32.420
is all water and blue.

19:33.590 --> 19:34.810
A little spider,

19:35.070 --> 19:35.980
all legs right through.

19:37.270 --> 19:38.490
Mortal humans

19:38.680 --> 19:39.730
are nothing but jaw.

19:40.160 --> 19:41.330
Come to Bear Island,

19:41.350 --> 19:42.220
best place you saw.

19:43.790 --> 19:45.010
When inspiration strikes,

19:45.070 --> 19:46.570
I can't hold it back.

19:48.110 --> 19:48.980
Next time,

19:49.000 --> 19:50.380
make sure you do.

19:52.270 --> 19:53.290
I am

19:53.590 --> 19:54.530
Hua Ritian.

19:54.530 --> 19:56.220
[Hua Ritian]

19:56.680 --> 19:57.900
Cool name.

19:58.590 --> 19:59.380
Ritian.
[*Sky-Breaker]

19:59.680 --> 20:00.570
May I ask your name?

20:01.270 --> 20:02.620
What were you doing just now?

20:03.720 --> 20:05.220
I just saw the scenery

20:06.070 --> 20:07.090
and painted a picture.

20:11.310 --> 20:12.180
To be honest,

20:14.000 --> 20:15.530
I am an artist.

20:16.480 --> 20:17.660
Coming to Bear Island

20:18.270 --> 20:19.700
was to pursue

20:20.790 --> 20:22.420
the peak of art.

20:24.200 --> 20:25.010
My friend,

20:26.110 --> 20:28.330
if you're interested in art,

20:28.960 --> 20:32.290
why not explore together

20:34.200 --> 20:36.180
art's highest summit?

20:41.720 --> 20:42.380
Where'd he go?

20:43.310 --> 20:44.570
Something is off here.

20:44.590 --> 20:45.730
Total lunatics.

20:51.000 --> 20:51.770
A footprint?

20:52.720 --> 20:54.090
Could it be Yunxiao?

20:55.030 --> 20:57.490
Usually she flies in the sky.

20:57.640 --> 20:59.250
Now she has come here,

20:59.830 --> 21:01.770
and cannot hide her tracks yet.

21:38.790 --> 21:39.980
So delicious.

21:40.640 --> 21:41.250
Do you want it?

21:43.000 --> 21:43.900
Then,

21:44.590 --> 21:46.330
what'll you trade for it?

21:47.920 --> 21:49.620
This is my favorite seashell.

21:51.160 --> 21:51.980
No need.

21:52.510 --> 21:54.620
Answer me one question.

21:54.960 --> 21:55.900
Answer right,

21:56.070 --> 21:57.330
and this fish is yours.

21:57.350 --> 21:58.700
Okay, ask anything.

21:59.200 --> 22:02.250
The Pregenesis Sword on this island.

22:02.270 --> 22:03.140
Where is it?

22:05.350 --> 22:07.330
A sword?

22:12.750 --> 22:13.900
Meal's ready.

22:14.480 --> 22:15.220
Time to eat.

22:15.790 --> 22:16.530
Great.

22:16.830 --> 22:17.460
Eat.

22:17.480 --> 22:17.810
Let's go.

22:19.350 --> 22:20.140
Dig in.

22:25.880 --> 22:26.730
Not eating?

22:28.160 --> 22:30.140
I have a sacred physique.
No need to eat.

22:31.240 --> 22:32.420
A sacred physique?

22:32.960 --> 22:33.730
What does that mean?

22:34.550 --> 22:35.530
Means she's not hungry.

22:37.270 --> 22:37.940
And...

22:38.550 --> 22:39.050
You too?

22:40.550 --> 22:41.290
I'm not hungry either.

22:43.400 --> 22:44.940
But he must be starving.

22:45.750 --> 22:47.290
You always eat the most.

22:47.310 --> 22:48.810
Save us some.

22:49.920 --> 22:51.010
Stop taking.

22:52.310 --> 22:53.770
Have we met somewhere?

22:56.000 --> 22:57.010
Uh...

22:57.550 --> 22:59.700
I don't think so.

23:01.270 --> 23:02.250
I know you.

23:04.510 --> 23:06.250
No, you don't?

23:11.110 --> 23:11.940
You're the human disciple

23:11.960 --> 23:13.220
who sparred with me in Dragon Palace.

23:13.240 --> 23:13.940
Am I right?

23:17.160 --> 23:18.620
Yes. I remember now.

23:19.240 --> 23:20.810
I forgot we sparred.

23:21.400 --> 23:23.290
Shh. I'm here in disguise.

23:23.310 --> 23:24.050
Keep it secret.

23:24.960 --> 23:25.460
Okay, okay.

23:25.480 --> 23:26.490
Same here.

23:27.960 --> 23:28.730
No, thank you.

23:30.550 --> 23:31.090
Say,

23:32.160 --> 23:33.940
did you see a bearded man

23:34.240 --> 23:35.380
in Dragon Palace?

23:37.240 --> 23:38.330
A bearded man?

23:38.480 --> 23:39.730
He's my savior.

23:40.070 --> 23:40.860
What?

23:41.720 --> 23:43.420
I came here to find him.

23:45.640 --> 23:46.940
No big beards here.

23:46.960 --> 23:48.180
Only little mustaches.

23:48.200 --> 23:49.620
Try looking elsewhere?

23:49.640 --> 23:50.420
He's not here.

23:50.790 --> 23:51.570
That can't be.

23:52.510 --> 23:54.220
I followed his scent

23:54.240 --> 23:55.140
all the way here.

23:55.310 --> 23:56.900
Dragons have sharp noses.

23:57.270 --> 23:57.900
He's...

24:00.030 --> 24:00.900
He's...

24:02.270 --> 24:03.140
He can barely hold it.

24:03.160 --> 24:04.220
Why not go help him?

24:05.590 --> 24:06.180
Okay.

24:12.720 --> 24:13.490
Yunxiao.

24:14.270 --> 24:15.050
Sometimes,

24:15.550 --> 24:17.330
I think you're pretty kind.

24:17.480 --> 24:18.770
I can be unkind too.

24:18.790 --> 24:19.940
You can stay kind.

24:19.960 --> 24:20.940
Depends on my mood.

24:21.200 --> 24:21.700
Alright.

24:22.750 --> 24:23.810
Fruit is here.

24:24.960 --> 24:25.730
Have some fruit.

24:26.830 --> 24:28.460
The four of us met by chance.

24:28.720 --> 24:30.050
Four strangers, with no ties.

24:30.110 --> 24:31.140
Yet today we gather here.

24:31.160 --> 24:32.180
I believe

24:33.160 --> 24:34.330
it's the call of destiny.

24:34.680 --> 24:35.980
So next, we shall face

24:36.270 --> 24:37.660
even harder challenges.

24:37.680 --> 24:40.250
I think we should be honest

24:40.590 --> 24:41.900
and join hands.

24:43.000 --> 24:44.530
Does he always talk like that?

24:44.550 --> 24:45.900
Just being dramatic.

24:46.030 --> 24:47.530
Well said, young lady.

24:47.750 --> 24:48.660
Between us,

24:49.030 --> 24:50.180
there should be no secrets.

24:50.510 --> 24:51.290
Greetings.

24:51.510 --> 24:52.900
I am Hua Ritian.

24:53.960 --> 24:54.860
May I have your name, lady?

24:56.160 --> 24:56.940
Ke Le'er.

24:57.750 --> 24:58.530
Ke Le'er.

24:59.000 --> 25:00.180
We met by chance.

25:00.200 --> 25:02.290
Your caution is only natural.

25:02.350 --> 25:03.900
But as she said,

25:03.960 --> 25:05.420
we should be honest

25:05.440 --> 25:06.530
and join hands.

25:06.550 --> 25:08.420
Fellow souls adrift...

25:10.160 --> 25:11.140
Nice name.

25:13.720 --> 25:14.490
What is yours?

25:15.110 --> 25:15.700
Qing Luan.

25:18.510 --> 25:19.460
I am Bai Shi.

25:22.960 --> 25:23.730
So,

25:24.350 --> 25:25.490
how do you know each other?

25:26.070 --> 25:26.980
What do you think?

25:27.550 --> 25:28.900
If I call you friends,

25:29.000 --> 25:31.250
there's an odd distance.

25:31.270 --> 25:32.530
If I call you strangers,

25:32.550 --> 25:33.380
yet you seem

25:34.110 --> 25:35.330
so synchronized.

25:35.720 --> 25:36.770
Strange, Ke Le'er?

25:37.160 --> 25:38.330
Truly strange.

25:38.920 --> 25:40.140
Feels like

25:40.400 --> 25:43.290
siblings share no blood.

25:43.310 --> 25:45.380
Old foes who clicked at first sight.

25:45.480 --> 25:47.900
Strangers with unspoken trust.

25:47.920 --> 25:50.140
Vengeful soulmates across the years.

25:50.160 --> 25:51.380
You're a couple.

25:51.680 --> 25:52.460
No.

25:58.440 --> 25:59.860
Hey, where are you going?

26:00.110 --> 26:00.860
Take me with you.

26:00.880 --> 26:01.730
None of your business.

26:02.110 --> 26:02.860
Get lost.

26:03.070 --> 26:03.860
Wait up.

26:03.860 --> 26:05.580
♪I dare to live my own way♪

26:06.310 --> 26:08.530
Definitely a couple.

26:09.780 --> 26:12.060
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

26:12.260 --> 26:14.310
♪Roaming the city with reckless courage♪

26:14.310 --> 26:16.640
♪Just watching swordplay while drunk♪

26:16.640 --> 26:18.460
♪And in dreams, I reign supreme♪

26:18.460 --> 26:20.500
♪Who can ever♪

26:20.880 --> 26:21.940
I heard

26:22.310 --> 26:25.140
a sword is at the peak.

26:25.270 --> 26:26.620
But that place is forbidden.

26:26.640 --> 26:27.660
We wouldn't dare go.

26:27.680 --> 26:29.050
You must not go either.

26:29.610 --> 26:31.780
♪Let the answer be empty♪

26:31.780 --> 26:32.930
♪A varied life♪

26:32.930 --> 26:36.060
♪Lives within all these things♪

26:36.350 --> 26:38.410
♪I drink in the oncoming breeze♪

26:38.410 --> 26:40.260
♪The steadiest surge♪

26:40.650 --> 26:42.840
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

26:42.840 --> 26:44.690
♪Karma never falls empty♪

26:44.690 --> 26:47.080
♪Let the thoughts weigh♪

26:47.080 --> 26:49.200
♪Fulfill the first wish♪

26:49.200 --> 26:50.340
♪Unruly♪

26:50.340 --> 26:53.360
♪A carefree smile♪

27:10.440 --> 27:11.730
Forbidden Land?

27:41.750 --> 27:44.090
There is no deity

27:44.350 --> 27:45.460
in...

28:00.260 --> 28:07.980
[There is no deity in this world]

28:08.110 --> 28:09.730
Did you not see

28:10.200 --> 28:11.220
the huge characters?

28:12.310 --> 28:13.420
I did.

28:13.480 --> 28:15.770
Thanks for not strangling me, I guess.

28:18.510 --> 28:19.460
Listen to me.

28:20.920 --> 28:23.250
That line on the stone,

28:23.640 --> 28:27.250
you must never say it aloud.

28:30.030 --> 28:31.420
Sounds so terrifying.

28:32.200 --> 28:33.660
Why can't I say it?

28:33.720 --> 28:35.530
You've been here for days now.

28:36.310 --> 28:37.530
Haven't you noticed

28:39.790 --> 28:40.980
this village

28:41.640 --> 28:42.980
is kind of strange?

28:48.720 --> 28:50.660
I do think it's strange.

28:51.920 --> 28:53.010
Do you know why?

28:57.070 --> 28:58.420
As for the reason behind it,

29:01.030 --> 29:02.420
I do not know either.

29:06.510 --> 29:07.730
But I can tell you

29:08.110 --> 29:10.620
what I saw with my own eyes.

29:14.160 --> 29:14.940
That year,

29:15.750 --> 29:18.140
pursuing the peak of art,

29:18.350 --> 29:19.940
I came to this island.

29:20.960 --> 29:23.330
The island welcomed me soon,

29:24.110 --> 29:28.220
and I found peace and joy here,

29:28.480 --> 29:32.730
reaching a new realm of art.

29:33.200 --> 29:33.980
However,

29:34.350 --> 29:35.620
I never imagined

29:35.960 --> 29:38.530
beneath its peaceful surface

29:39.550 --> 29:43.620
lay a hidden, dark side.

29:44.960 --> 29:45.810
I quit.

29:45.920 --> 29:47.250
Digging like this every day...

29:47.270 --> 29:48.860
What is it all for?

29:51.640 --> 29:52.490
Xiong Datou.

29:52.510 --> 29:53.290
What are you doing?

29:53.480 --> 29:53.810
Shh.

29:53.830 --> 29:55.140
All we do is dig.

29:55.160 --> 29:56.570
What's it for exactly?

29:57.240 --> 29:59.180
For the Deity, of course.

29:59.310 --> 30:00.530
The Deity blesses us

30:00.550 --> 30:01.460
and gives us a home.

30:01.480 --> 30:02.860
We must repay him.

30:02.880 --> 30:03.810
Nonsense.

30:04.270 --> 30:05.330
- That's not true.
- Watch it.

30:05.350 --> 30:05.900
Hold your tongue.

30:05.920 --> 30:07.620
I entered the Forbidden Land.

30:07.640 --> 30:07.980
He...

30:08.270 --> 30:09.010
- The Forbidden Land?
- He went there?

30:09.030 --> 30:10.290
That will anger the Deity.

30:10.880 --> 30:12.570
You're all fooled.

30:13.480 --> 30:15.900
No one is protecting us at all.

30:15.920 --> 30:17.330
In there stands a stone stele,

30:17.350 --> 30:19.980
saying there is no deity in this world.

30:20.200 --> 30:21.460
No deity.

30:22.160 --> 30:23.730
Xiong Datou, you're crazy. Stop lying.

30:23.750 --> 30:24.330
Get down.

30:24.350 --> 30:25.490
No deity.

30:25.830 --> 30:26.380
Nonsense.

30:26.400 --> 30:27.180
You're all fooled.

30:27.200 --> 30:27.900
Stop the nonsense.

30:27.920 --> 30:29.250
You're all fooled.

30:29.270 --> 30:30.900
No deity at all.

30:30.920 --> 30:31.460
Xiong Datou.

30:31.480 --> 30:32.220
No deity.

30:43.240 --> 30:44.010
Forgive us.

30:44.030 --> 30:45.620
We beg for your forgiveness.

30:45.640 --> 30:46.620
Show mercy.

30:46.640 --> 30:48.250
You're all fooled.

30:49.480 --> 30:50.490
Show mercy.

30:51.510 --> 30:52.420
Please, mercy.

30:52.440 --> 30:53.700
It was our fault.

30:53.720 --> 30:54.730
Take pity on us.

30:54.880 --> 30:56.250
Have some mercy.

31:00.510 --> 31:01.330
Spare our lives.

31:01.960 --> 31:02.770
Forgive our sins.

31:08.550 --> 31:09.420
He's gone.

31:10.240 --> 31:10.700
Let's go.

31:10.960 --> 31:12.140
Where is Xiong Datou?

31:13.790 --> 31:14.980
Datou is gone.

31:15.000 --> 31:15.810
Where's Datou?

31:21.030 --> 31:23.730
We... we love Bear Island.

31:23.830 --> 31:25.860
Bear Island is so great.

31:25.880 --> 31:27.900
Listen to the deity.

31:27.920 --> 31:29.940
And we'll live forever.

31:29.960 --> 31:31.860
We love Bear Island.

31:31.880 --> 31:33.810
Bear Island is so great.

31:33.830 --> 31:36.040
- Listen to the deity.
- After that,

31:36.080 --> 31:39.380
- the man was never seen again.
- And we'll live forever.

31:39.880 --> 31:40.660
However,

31:40.920 --> 31:42.090
a few days later,

31:43.000 --> 31:44.420
when the tide came in,

31:45.640 --> 31:47.050
it washed up

31:48.070 --> 31:49.460
a severed arm,

31:50.720 --> 31:51.570
still wearing

31:52.960 --> 31:55.330
his clothes from that day.

32:02.590 --> 32:03.730
Is someone over there?

32:05.070 --> 32:05.730
Where?

32:06.480 --> 32:07.140
Who's there?

32:07.160 --> 32:08.330
Didn't you see?

32:09.070 --> 32:09.900
Right there.

32:13.160 --> 32:14.250
I see no one.

32:14.960 --> 32:17.250
Scaring yourself
with your made-up story?

32:17.590 --> 32:18.700
Not made-up.

32:19.000 --> 32:19.770
It's all true.

32:20.550 --> 32:21.730
Pathetic.

32:45.880 --> 32:46.770
There's a bearded man over there.

33:04.350 --> 33:05.140
Yunxiao.

33:06.070 --> 33:07.900
Could you stop wandering off?

33:07.960 --> 33:09.660
Why do you always care where I go?

33:10.070 --> 33:12.330
The atmosphere on this island
is so eerie.

33:12.350 --> 33:13.620
And you have no power.

33:13.680 --> 33:15.420
You should be more careful.

33:15.440 --> 33:16.570
Even without power,

33:16.920 --> 33:18.290
I must find the Pregenesis Sword.

33:18.720 --> 33:19.490
Yunxiao.

33:20.310 --> 33:21.140
Your stubbornness

33:21.160 --> 33:22.860
makes things tough for me.

33:23.880 --> 33:25.050
What's it to you?

33:26.200 --> 33:27.570
Why are you so set

33:27.590 --> 33:28.810
on getting the Sea-Calming Pillar?

33:28.830 --> 33:30.660
What lies beneath the Eye of the Sea?

33:30.680 --> 33:31.530
- You can't just...
- Enough.

33:31.550 --> 33:32.490
Negotiation over.

33:34.790 --> 33:35.570
Yunxiao.

33:35.880 --> 33:37.460
If you refuse to listen,

33:37.830 --> 33:39.180
I won't be nice anymore.

33:41.400 --> 33:42.180
You wouldn't dare.

33:44.590 --> 33:46.140
Neither of us has power anyway.

33:48.550 --> 33:49.620
Bring it on.

33:51.590 --> 33:52.380
Oh yeah?

33:53.310 --> 33:53.940
Fine then.

33:55.310 --> 33:57.220
Ke Le'er.

33:57.240 --> 33:57.980
Hold on.

33:58.510 --> 33:59.290
What's up?

33:59.640 --> 34:00.620
Found my savior for me?

34:00.880 --> 34:01.810
You bet.

34:01.920 --> 34:02.660
Well,

34:02.680 --> 34:03.810
you see him every day.

34:04.070 --> 34:04.980
He is...

34:05.000 --> 34:06.700
He is Hua Ritian.

34:07.200 --> 34:07.660
Think about it.

34:07.680 --> 34:08.740
Just four outsiders.

34:08.760 --> 34:09.740
Qing Luan is a girl.

34:09.760 --> 34:10.340
Excluding yourself,

34:10.360 --> 34:11.090
and you know my deal.

34:11.110 --> 34:11.900
Who else could it be?

34:11.960 --> 34:12.690
Hua Ritian.

34:12.710 --> 34:13.340
Exactly.

34:14.030 --> 34:14.570
Makes sense.

34:15.150 --> 34:16.340
Wait, actually...

34:16.360 --> 34:17.900
Actually, he's been hiding his identity.

34:17.920 --> 34:19.090
That must be intentional.

34:19.110 --> 34:19.980
Since he's your savior,

34:20.000 --> 34:20.860
he definitely recognizes you.

34:20.880 --> 34:22.340
So why pretend not to know you?

34:22.360 --> 34:23.610
Means he's protecting you.

34:24.000 --> 34:25.340
That makes total sense.

34:25.510 --> 34:26.740
Think further.

34:27.030 --> 34:28.690
If he had a fake beard...

34:28.710 --> 34:30.460
With a beard, wouldn't he look closer?

34:35.400 --> 34:36.490
- Seems so.
- Definitely looks closer.

34:36.510 --> 34:37.380
So go find Hua Ritian.

34:37.400 --> 34:38.170
Test him right away.

34:38.190 --> 34:38.380
Okay.

34:38.400 --> 34:38.940
Go find him.

34:38.960 --> 34:39.530
Hurry.

34:41.840 --> 34:42.940
Quick tongue, huh?

34:44.150 --> 34:44.980
Fortunately.

35:00.480 --> 35:01.300
Stop sniffing.

35:01.920 --> 35:03.130
I bathe every day.

35:03.400 --> 35:04.300
No body odor.

35:07.360 --> 35:09.530
You admire the view here daily.

35:09.760 --> 35:10.900
But the view here is

35:11.670 --> 35:12.460
ordinary.

35:12.550 --> 35:13.340
Ordinary?

35:16.110 --> 35:16.940
Ordinary.

35:17.280 --> 35:17.900
That's the point.

35:19.110 --> 35:19.900
Ordinary

35:20.840 --> 35:22.130
is where its beauty lies.

35:24.710 --> 35:26.740
Every word you say

35:27.440 --> 35:29.130
sounds so profound.

35:33.960 --> 35:35.170
Even to the ends of the sea,

35:36.960 --> 35:38.170
a true soulmate is rare to see.

35:42.920 --> 35:44.980
If you want to leave someday,

35:45.880 --> 35:48.010
I can show you better views.

35:49.480 --> 35:50.130
Where to?

35:52.920 --> 35:53.820
Hua.

35:55.150 --> 35:56.490
Have you seen the Dragon Palace?

35:58.630 --> 35:59.530
Dragon Palace?

36:03.840 --> 36:05.380
Carved pillars, jade tiles,

36:06.320 --> 36:07.610
decked in pearls and jewels.

36:08.320 --> 36:09.530
Utterly lavish,

36:11.000 --> 36:12.420
yet dark and dreary.

36:14.550 --> 36:16.010
Not as open and free as here.

36:16.480 --> 36:17.780
You really went there?

36:18.550 --> 36:19.130
I've seen it.

36:20.400 --> 36:21.570
Have you seen a dragon?

36:24.360 --> 36:25.610
Summoning clouds and rain,

36:26.230 --> 36:27.380
soaring in the skies,

36:28.000 --> 36:29.050
arrogant and mighty,

36:31.760 --> 36:33.380
yet trapped in the sea.

36:34.360 --> 36:36.380
So true, Hua.

36:36.510 --> 36:37.420
You really are...

36:37.440 --> 36:38.420
I've seen

36:40.630 --> 36:41.420
too much.

36:43.480 --> 36:44.340
Way too much.

36:46.670 --> 36:47.300
So,

36:48.150 --> 36:49.490
you're so amazing.

36:49.550 --> 36:50.820
Why stay on Bear Island?

36:52.670 --> 36:53.460
Bear Island?

36:54.150 --> 36:55.090
What's wrong with it?

36:57.000 --> 36:58.170
This peaceful sanctuary

36:58.960 --> 36:59.940
is so quiet and serene.

37:00.670 --> 37:02.260
Doesn't it entrance you?

37:02.960 --> 37:05.090
I've been to many scenic places.

37:05.110 --> 37:06.530
Compared to those,

37:06.760 --> 37:07.650
this is nothing.

37:08.800 --> 37:09.820
What have you seen?

37:10.320 --> 37:10.900
I...

37:14.000 --> 37:15.940
Have you seen the world's creation?

37:17.440 --> 37:18.740
Heaven and earth blended as one.

37:19.190 --> 37:20.490
Vast without directions.

37:21.670 --> 37:22.690
Have you seen 100,000 stars

37:22.710 --> 37:24.210
destruct all at once?

37:27.150 --> 37:28.650
Light illuminated everything,

37:29.880 --> 37:31.130
then destroyed it all.

37:32.190 --> 37:33.940
Have you seen reincarnation?

37:34.760 --> 37:36.780
Seen hellish ghosts wailing?

37:37.230 --> 37:39.780
Seen tragic partings
in the mortal world?

37:42.760 --> 37:43.610
I have.

37:47.360 --> 37:48.420
I've seen

37:50.230 --> 37:51.010
too much.

37:53.630 --> 37:54.610
Way too much.

38:02.440 --> 38:03.380
Let me tell you,

38:06.550 --> 38:07.380
in this world,

38:09.760 --> 38:11.050
the rarest beauty

38:12.670 --> 38:13.820
is being ordinary.

38:15.000 --> 38:15.610
My savior.

38:16.190 --> 38:17.940
You are my lifelong faith.

38:22.190 --> 38:23.340
It is everything

38:26.070 --> 38:27.690
right before your eyes.

38:56.340 --> 38:59.620
[Forbidden Land]

39:13.900 --> 39:22.460
[Forbidden Land]

39:25.550 --> 39:26.530
Yunxiao's footprint.

39:28.590 --> 39:31.210
Hope she never learns
to hide her tracks.

39:40.320 --> 39:41.300
This is...

39:46.550 --> 39:47.530
an Object-Seeking Talisman.

39:48.150 --> 39:50.340
No power works on Bear Island,

39:50.360 --> 39:52.570
why would someone burn a talisman?

39:53.820 --> 39:58.100
[There is no deity in this world]

40:14.180 --> 40:15.740
[Because...]

40:16.030 --> 40:19.130
Today's rocks are hauled up.

40:19.840 --> 40:20.900
Great Deity,

40:21.230 --> 40:24.300
you can inspect anytime.

40:24.920 --> 40:25.940
A local?

40:25.960 --> 40:27.460
You've been digging for centuries.

40:27.480 --> 40:29.130
When will you find it?

40:29.840 --> 40:30.780
Telepathy.

40:30.800 --> 40:32.090
We've done all we can.

40:32.110 --> 40:34.050
Isn't power forbidden here?

40:34.070 --> 40:36.420
Great Deity,

40:36.550 --> 40:37.460
we'd never

40:37.760 --> 40:40.940
dare neglect your orders.

40:40.960 --> 40:42.420
Then keep digging.

40:42.440 --> 40:43.980
Dig another few centuries.

40:44.000 --> 40:46.530
I believe
the Pregenesis Sword will show.

40:46.590 --> 40:48.130
Someone else is hunting the sword?

41:02.670 --> 41:03.170
This is

41:05.550 --> 41:06.420
a formation?

41:14.000 --> 41:14.740
Check it for me.

41:14.760 --> 41:16.490
How long until the Great Tribulation?

41:17.150 --> 41:19.860
Thirty years remain.

41:20.510 --> 41:21.380
Thirty years.

41:22.070 --> 41:24.090
Sword appears
and opens the Eye of the Sea,

41:24.110 --> 41:25.260
triggering Great Tribulation.

41:26.440 --> 41:27.610
Even if Fairy Yunxiao fails,

41:27.630 --> 41:29.300
others will grab the Pregenesis Sword.

41:33.590 --> 41:34.570
In that case,

41:35.760 --> 41:37.300
the only way to break this

41:38.760 --> 41:40.780
is to obtain the Pregenesis Sword

41:43.190 --> 41:44.900
before anyone else.

42:17.590 --> 42:23.370
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

42:24.040 --> 42:30.740
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

42:32.270 --> 42:38.320
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

42:38.950 --> 42:45.400
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

42:46.140 --> 42:53.260
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:53.640 --> 43:00.540
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:00.920 --> 43:08.270
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

43:08.270 --> 43:15.440
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

43:31.580 --> 43:36.750
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

43:37.840 --> 43:44.860
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

43:46.050 --> 43:51.990
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

43:52.690 --> 43:59.770
♪Alas, our story is short♪

44:00.110 --> 44:07.220
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

44:07.540 --> 44:14.020
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

44:14.800 --> 44:22.010
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

44:22.400 --> 44:30.220
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
